cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this library in research or writing, please cite it as below."
title: "osint-trust-envelope"
abstract: >-
  Per-source-type epistemic ceilings for OSINT results: every lookup is wrapped
  in a trust envelope (verified / inferred / heuristic / unverified) whose
  confidence is enforced against a published band, so a result cannot assert
  more than its weakest source supports. Zero runtime dependencies.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "WRG-11"
repository-code: "https://github.com/WRG-11/osint-trust-envelope"
license: MIT
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-09-05"
keywords:
  - osint
  - threat-intelligence
  - trust
  - epistemics
  - zero-dependency
